HR Management API – Business Logic Modules

Overview

Person 3 is responsible for developing the core HR features of the system, including employee management, departments, positions, leave requests, and payroll processing.

Assigned Files

routers/
├── employees.py
├── departments.py
├── positions.py
├── leaves.py
└── payroll.py
schemas.py (shared with Person 2)

Responsibilities

Employee Management

* Create, view, update, and delete employees.
* Search and manage employee profiles.

Department Management

* Create, view, update, and delete departments.
* Assign employees to departments.

Position Management

* Manage job positions and descriptions.

Leave Management

* Submit, approve, and reject leave requests.
* Track leave history and balances.

Payroll Management

* Generate payroll records.
* Calculate salaries, deductions, and allowances.

Testing

Create tests for all endpoints:

tests/
├── test_employees.py
├── test_departments.py
├── test_positions.py
├── test_leaves.py
└── test_payroll.py

Branches

* feature/employees
* feature/departments
* feature/positions
* feature/leaves
* feature/payroll

Deliverables

* Employee CRUD API
* Department API
* Position API
* Leave Management API
* Payroll API
* Updated Schemas
* Tests and Documentation